<title>USA: LOT lifts ex-US cargo fuel surcharge.</title>
<headline>LOT lifts ex-US cargo fuel surcharge.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>LOT Polish Airlines will scrap its 10 cents per kilo surcharge on all flights from the U.S. to Poland with effect May 1, Margaret Budnica, New York City Cargo Sales Manager told Reuters.</p>
<p>The carrier imposed the surcharge on December 8, 1996, Budnicka said. -Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542-7706 Fax+5017</p>
</text>
